Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:09:22 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] cuda: sm_30 / CUDA 10.2 / clang port for old NVIDIA GPUs
 (6uO, llama.cpp discussion #29961)

This is 6uO's patch for ggml 0.25.3 from https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/discussions/29961, released by 6uO under the MIT license (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/discussions/29961#discussioncomment-19833442).

Forward-ported to llama.cpp v0.8.0 (ggml 0.28.0): 123 of 142 hunks applied at fuzz <= 2. The 19 rejected hunks were re-applied by AI coding agents, adapted to the newer code where needed. Our own fixes to the port follow in the next commit.
